cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the CATCH paper (Li et al.) along with the
  component methods it wraps: LDSC (Bulik-Sullivan et al. 2015), CELLECT and CELLEX
  (Timshel et al. 2020), Cepo (Kim et al. 2021), seismic (Lai et al. 2025), mBAT-combo
  (Li et al. 2023), and scDRS (Zhang et al. 2022). See the README's Citation section
  for the full reference list.
title: CATCH Pipeline
authors:
